<title>HONG KONG: Wing Lung Bank places HK$150 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Wing Lung Bank places HK$150 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wing Lung Bank has lodged a HK$150 million floating rate certificates of deposit issue due May 15, 1998, with the Hong Kong Monetary Authority Central Moneymarkets Unit.</p>
<p>The certificates were issued at 99.88 to float at 15 basis points over the three-month Hong Kong Interbank Offered Rate.</p>
<p>Hongkong and Shanghai Banking Corp was the lead manager.</p>
<p>The issue was off the bank's HK$3.0 billion CD programme.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
